                dan
                <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">dev</code>,
                di dalam
                <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">package.json</code>:
