                Buat juga <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">tsconfig.json</code>
                agar TypeScript mengenali lingkungan Node (seperti <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">process</code>
                dan modul bawaan) serta <em>import</em> bergaya <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">./file.ts</code>,
                sehingga editor/LSP tidak menandai error:
            </p>
            <CodeBlock code={tsconfig} language="json" filename="tsconfig.json" compact />
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
                <li>
                    <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">"main": "src/index.ts"</code>
